{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2019-10-03 19:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN CO GAS SAYS ILLINOIS COMMISSION APPROVED $168 MLN ANNUAL BASE RATE INCREASE', 'text': 'SOUTHERN CO GAS - ON OCT 2, ILLINOIS COMMISSION VOTED ON GENERAL BASE RATE CASE PROCEEDING FILED BY NORTHERN ILLINOIS GAS COMPANY IN NOVEMBER 2018.SOUTHERN CO GAS - ILLINOIS COMMISSION APPROVED $168 MILLION ANNUAL BASE RATE INCREASE.SOUTHERN CO GAS - ILLINOIS COMMISSION APPROVAL INCLUDES $65 MILLION RELATED TO RECOVERY OF INVESTMENTS UNDER THE INVESTING IN ILLINOIS PROGRAM.'}